        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 435,
        "step_number": 8,
        "text": "Step 8: We are given that the number of leaves is greater than 100. So, we need to find the smallest \\( m \\) such that:\n\\[ 7m + 5 > 100 \\]\n\\[ 7m > 95 \\]\n\\[ m > \\frac{95}{7} \\approx 13.57 \\]"
      },
